Dear Theodore,

When you set the contrasts option, the first entry applies to factors, the 
second to ordered factors. The categorical variable in question must be a 
factor (i.e., an unordered factor), and so contr.treatment would be used in 
both of the cases that you describe.

I hope that this helps,
 John

