Dear Theodore,

you obtain the same results because in both:

options(contrasts=c(factor="contr.treatment",
ordered="contr.treatment"))

options(contrasts=c(factor="contr.treatment", ordered="contr.poly"))

the first argument is for factors (your case) and the second for
ordered factors (see "?options" for more details)!!

I hope this helps.

Best,
Dimitris

