Dear All,

 

Sometime ago I made an enquiry about the sobol 
sequence generator and vectosied version of optimize. 

 

In summary:

 

There does not seem to be a sobol sequence 
generator in Splus, however other quasi random number generators like 
rquasi() may be used as a substitute. 

 

inverseFunction() works like a vectorised version 
of optimize. 

 

Both of these functions are available in the resample (beta version) library of Splus. 
However, it may be a good idea to wait for a few weeks for some of the minor 
changes insightful are currently working on this library. 

 

