As you can see the results are identical!

After confirming that the three-way treatment interaction is
not significant, I have rolled it into the Within stratum
residuals giving the following model:

> test<-aov(ht01~trt+blk+stk+rep+tend+trt:stk+trt:tend+stk:tend+
